# 34. MOST IMPORTANT UX PRINCIPLE

The user should never feel:

> “I have to manage HomeOS.”

Instead, they should feel:

> **“HomeOS manages the information for me.”**

Therefore:

### Reduce manual data entry.

Use AI to extract information.

### Reduce searching.

Use semantic search.

### Reduce remembering.

Automatically create reminders.

### Reduce complexity.

Show only what needs attention.

### Reduce anxiety.

Clearly show:

**All good**

when nothing requires action.

